description: Use hyphenated re-measure; never remasure or remeasure
alwaysApply: true
---

# Wording: re-measure

When writing about measuring again (RPS, memory, UI layout), use the hyphenated form **re-measure** (and **re-measurement**).

Never write `remasure` or `remeasure` in code, comments, docs, wiki, the website, commit messages, or plans.
